Package: voicestudio
Version: 1.1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: termux-learn-crypto <vilasrmeshram400@gmail.com>
Depends: bash, curl, git, python, python-pip, ffmpeg, clang, binutils, make, cmake, pkg-config, libsndfile, portaudio, libffi, openssl, libxml2, libxslt, zlib, libjpeg-turbo, libpng, rust, python-numpy, python-scipy, python-pillow, python-cryptography, python-psutil, python-torch, python-torchaudio
Recommends: python-onnxruntime, termux-api
Suggests: python-torchvision
Homepage: https://github.com/termux-learn-crypto/VoiceStudio
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Description: VoiceStudio (TTS / voice studio) for Termux, CPU only
 apt installs python, torch, ffmpeg, rust and the other system
 dependencies; the install step then clones VoiceStudio (termux
 branch) into ~/VoiceStudio and sets up its Python venv and web UI.
 First install can take 15-30 min (pydantic-core compiles with Rust).
 Commands: voicestudio (start, UI on http://127.0.0.1:3900),
 voicestudio-setup (update / repair).
